    <summary>Fast CLI tool and desktop GUI application for uploading files to Nextcloud and generating instant share links.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Nextcloud Upload Tool (`nut`) is a fast, cross-platform CLI and desktop GUI application for uploading files and streams to Nextcloud via WebDAV and generating instant public share and direct-download links via the OCS Sharing API.

### Features
- **Streaming WebDAV Uploads**: Upload files, directories, and `stdin` pipelines with real-time progress bars.
- **Instant Share & Direct Links**: Generate public share links and direct-download URLs (`--url-only`, `--direct-url-only`).
- **Secure Credential Storage**: Uses Windows Credential Manager with Login Flow v2 browser authorization.
- **Multi-Account Support**: Switch seamlessly between multiple Nextcloud servers and accounts.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/headhunter45/NextcloudUploadTool/releases/tag/v0.1.0</releaseNotes>
